 Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>that fox.This was probably Herod Antipas, tetrarch of Galilee, who is described by Josephus as a crafty and incestuous prince, with which the character given him by our Lord, and the narratives of the evangelists, exactly coincide.</p>\n<p>3:19,20; 9:7-9; 23:8-11; Eze 13:4; Mic 3:1-3; Zep 3:3; Mr 6:26-28 I cast. 9:7; Mr 6:14; Joh 10:32; 11:8-10 I shall. Joh 17:4,5; 19:30; *Gr: Heb 2:10; 5:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-13-33","title":"Luke 13:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>I must. Joh 4:34; 9:4; 11:54; 12:35; Ac 10:38 for. 9:53; Mt 20:18; Ac 13:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-13-34","title":"Luke 13:34","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":34,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":34},"content":"<p>Jerusalem. 19:41,42; Mt 23:37-39 killest. 2Ch 24:21,22; 36:15,16; Ne 9:26; Jer 2:30; 26:23; La 4:13 Mt 21:35,36; 22:6; Ac 7:52,59; 8:1; Re 11:8 how. De 5:29; 32:29; Ps 81:10,13; Isa 48:17-19; 50:2 thy. 19:44; 23:28; Ps 149:2; La 1:16; Joe 2:23; Ga 4:25,26 as. De 32:11,12; Ru 2:12; Ps 17:8; 36:7; 57:1; 91:4 and ye. 15:28; Ne 9:30; Ps 81:11; Pr 1:24-30; Isa 30:15; Jer 6:16; 7:23,24 Jer 35:14; 44:4-6; Ho 11:2,7; Zec 1:4; Mt 22:3; Ac 3:14,15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-13-35","title":"Luke 13:35","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":35,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":35},"content":"<p>your. 21:5,6,24; Le 26:31,32; Ps 69:25; Isa 1:7,8; 5:5,6; 64:10,11 Da 9:26,27; Mic 3:12; Zec 11:1,2; 14:2; Ac 6:13,14 Ye shall not. Ho 3:4,5; Joh 7:34-36; 8:22-24; 12:35,36; 14:19-23 Blessed. 19:38-40; Ps 118:26; Isa 40:9-11; 52:7; Zec 12:10; Mt 21:9; Mr 11:9 Mr 11:10; Joh 12:13; Ro 10:9-15; 2Co 3:15-18</p>"}]}